<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Batik Nusantara - Batik Premium Berkualitas Tinggi</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:wght@700;900&family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        :root {
            --dark-brown: #3B2A1A;
            --cream: #F8F1E5;
            --gold: #D4AF37;
            --light-cream: #FBF8F3;
            --text-dark: #2D2D2D;
            --text-light: #666666;
            --border-color: #E5DDD0;
            --shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(59, 42, 26, 0.08);
            --shadow-hover: 0 8px 25px rgba(59, 42, 26, 0.15);
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
            color: var(--text-dark);
            background-color: var(--light-cream);
            line-height: 1.6;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6 {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            color: var(--dark-brown);
        }

        /* ==================== NAVBAR ==================== */
        .navbar {
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--dark-brown) 0%, #4A3428 100%);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
            z-index: 1000;
            padding: 0;
        }

        .navbar-container {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 15px 50px;
            max-width: 100%;
        }

        .navbar-logo {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: var(--gold);
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .navbar-logo span {
            color: var(--cream);
        }

        .nav-menu {
            display: flex;
            list-style: none;
            gap: 30px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .nav-item {
            position: relative;
        }

        .nav-link {
            color: var(--cream);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
            padding: 8px 0;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 5px;
        }

        .nav-link:hover,
        .nav-item.active > .nav-link {
            color: var(--gold);
        }

        .dropdown-menu {
            position: absolute;
            top: 100%;
            left: 0;
            background: white;
            min-width: 200px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover);
            opacity: 0;
            visibility: hidden;
            transform: translateY(-10px);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            margin-top: 10px;
            z-index: 1001;
        }

        .nav-item:hover .dropdown-menu {
            opacity: 1;
            visibility: visible;
            transform: translateY(0);
        }

        .dropdown-item {
            padding: 12px 20px;
            color: var(--text-dark);
            text-decoration: none;
            display: block;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            font-size: 13px;
            border-left: 3px solid transparent;
        }

        .dropdown-item:hover {
            background-color: var(--light-cream);
            color: var(--gold);
            border-left-color: var(--gold);
            padding-left: 25px;
        }

        /* ==================== HERO SECTION ==================== */
        .hero {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--dark-brown) 0%, #4A3428 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 100px 50px;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            min-height: 500px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .hero-content {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 2;
            max-width: 700px;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 56px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: var(--cream);
            line-height: 1.2;
        }

        .hero h1 span {
            color: var(--gold);
        }

        /* ==================== SECTION STYLES ==================== */
        section {
            padding: 80px 50px;
        }

        .section-title {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 60px;
        }

        .section-title h2 {
            font-size: 44px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            position: relative;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        .section-title h2::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -10px;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            width: 80px;
            height: 3px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--gold), transparent);
        }

        /* ==================== ARTICLE / BLOG SECTION ==================== */
        .articles-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
            margin-top: 50px;
        }

        .article-card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        .article-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-8px);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover);
        }

        .article-image {
            width: 100%;
            height: 200px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4A3428, var(--dark-brown));
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: var(--gold);
            font-size: 40px;
        }

        .article-content {
            padding: 25px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            flex-grow: 1;
        }

        .article-category {
            color: var(--gold);
            font-size: 12px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .article-title {
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            color: var(--dark-brown);
        }

        .article-date {
            color: var(--text-light);
            font-size: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .article-excerpt {
            color: var(--text-light);
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            flex-grow: 1; /* Mendorong tombol ke bawah agar sejajar */
        }

        /* PERBAIKAN UTAMA: Fokus klik Baca Selengkapnya */
        .read-more {
            color: var(--dark-brown);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 14px;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 5px;
            width: fit-content;
            transition: color 0.3s ease, gap 0.3s ease;
        }

        /* Efek interaktif saat tombol didekati kursor */
        .read-more:hover {
            color: var(--gold);
            gap: 10px; /* Membuat ikon panah bergeser ke kanan saat di-hover */
        }

        /* ==================== RESPONSIVE ==================== */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .navbar-container { padding: 15px 20px; }
            section { padding: 50px 20px; }
            .hero h1 { font-size: 36px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <nav class="navbar">
        <div class="navbar-container">
            <div class="navbar-logo">
                <span>Batik</span> Nusantara
            </div>
            <ul class="nav-menu">
                <li class="nav-item active"><a href="#home" class="nav-link">Home</a></li>
                <li class="nav-item">
                    <a href="#shop" class="nav-link">Shop ▼</a>
                    <div class="dropdown-menu">
                        <a href="#" class="dropdown-item">Batik Pria</a>
                        <a href="#" class="dropdown-item">Batik Wanita</a>
                        <a href="#" class="dropdown-item">Kain Batik</a>
                    </div>
                </li>
                <li class="nav-item"><a href="#blog" class="nav-link">Blog</a></li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <header class="hero" id="home">
        <div class="hero-content">
            <h1>Pesona <span>Batik</span> Warisan Budaya</h1>
        </div>
    </header>

    <section id="blog">
        <div class="section-title">
            <h2>Artikel & Blog Terbaru</h2>
            <p>Eksplorasi cerita, filosofi, dan perkembangan tren dunia batik modern.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="articles-grid">
            
            <div class="article-card">
                <div class="article-image">🎨</div>
                <div class="article-content">
                    <div class="article-category">Budaya</div>
                    <h3 class="article-title">Filosofi Mendalam di Balik Motif Batik Parang</h3>
                    <div class="article-date">12 Juni 2026</div>
                    <p class="article-excerpt">Motif Parang merupakan salah satu motif batik tertua di Indonesia. Kain ini memiliki makna jalinan yang tidak pernah putus...</p>
                    <a href="blog/filosofi-batik-parang.html" class="read-more">Baca Selengkapnya <span>→</span></a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="article-card">
                <div class="article-image">🧵</div>
                <div class="article-content">
                    <div class="article-category">Tren Modern</div>
                    <h3 class="article-title">Cara Padupadan Batik Tulis untuk Gaya Casual</h3>
                    <div class="article-date">05 Juni 2026</div>
                    <p class="article-excerpt">Siapa bilang batik tulis hanya untuk acara formal? Dengan kombinasi yang tepat, Anda bisa tampil kasual dan modis sehari-hari...</p>
                    <a href="blog/batik-casual-style.html" class="read-more">Baca Selengkapnya <span>→</span></a>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>

</body>
</html>